Package: libethercat1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: IgH EtherCAT master — runtime shared library
 Shared library (libethercat.so.1) used by realtime applications that
 access the EtherCAT master through the ecrt.h API.

