Description: IgH EtherCAT master — development files
 Headers (ecrt.h, ectty.h), static archive, pkg-config and CMake
 descriptors for building realtime applications against the
 IgH EtherCAT master.

Package: ethercat-dkms
Architecture: all
Section: kernel
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 dkms,
 make,
 gcc,
 libc6-dev | libc-dev
Recommends: linux-headers-generic | linux-headers-amd64 | linux-headers-arm64 | linux-headers
Description: IgH EtherCAT master — kernel module source (DKMS)
 Source tree for the EtherCAT master and included network-card drivers,
 built against the running kernel by DKMS when the package is installed.
